    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2021_0066","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Þóra Dubois-Ngata talks about listening to grey. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
